#HELPS
-1 HOLY_GROVE_CHANGES~
01.10.05 - Added color and effects to the Obelisk. (Mag)
03.29.09 - Spelling corrections. (Order)
03.29.09 - Expanded variables in mprogs to give more variety to mobs. (Order)
03.30.09 - Added MAP_HOLY_GROVE. (Order)
~
-1 HOLY_GROVE~
Holy Grove is a place of happiness, a calm peaceful place where the citizens
of the realm come to celebrate the spring, where farmers give thanks for
bountiful harvests in the fall, and where lovers stroll in the summer. 

version 1.7 May 31 1998
Modified by Daith and Superdave~
