#MOBILES
#8900
hierophant~
The Hierophant~
The old Hierophant of the holy grove is here gathering holly.~
He is a very old man, dressed in an old robe; but from the glint in his
clear blue eyes you can see that he is aware of the world, and wise to its
traps and pitfalls.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_WIMPY|ACT_TRAIN|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S
20 BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 20d20+180 1d8+15
5000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 0
  if sex ($n) == 1
    say Greetings young man, would you care to help me?
  endif
  if sex ($n) == 2
    say Greetings young lady, would you care to help me?
  endif
  break
endif
if actorhasobjnum(8923)
  say I see you have found some holly!
  say May I have it please?
  break
endif
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
  say I'm still waiting for you to bring me some holly.
  say Perhaps you can find some in the DRAGON's garden.
endif
~
>speech_prog dragon~
say The Great Dragon Archibald lives in the home to the south of the croquet
lawn. Perhaps you can find some holly there in his garden.~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 0
  say I need some holly leaves for my magic potion.
  say Gather me some holly and I will reward you.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
else
  say Yes what?
endif
~
>speech_prog no~
say well thanks anyway.
grumble 
~
>give_prog i8923~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 2 
  say Thank you for your help.
  say Please take this as a reward.
  mpecho $I weaves some of the holly together.
  mpjunk i8923
  mpoload 8924
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpquiet off
  give i8924 $n
else
  say Thank you for bringing me more holly!
  smile $n
endif
~
|
